# An allow-list: only what the server runs from goes into the build. The deny-list before it let a developer's .claude, .codegraph, temp and
# review folders (about 1 GB) into every server image (P31-05, 2026-11-19). tools/ stays out: workspace members not needed at runtime.
# The installer bundle the site serves at /install/ is built on the host before the image (tools/devbox/deploy.sh runs
# tools/agent-bridge/install/build.mjs into packages/plugins/bot-runners/install-dist), so it arrives with packages/.
*
!package.json
!pnpm-lock.yaml
!pnpm-workspace.yaml
!tsconfig.base.json
!.nvmrc
!packages
!clients
!avatars
!templates
**/node_modules
**/dist
